  "description": "Microsoft Graph-backed group resolver and identity directory for Orleans.Lattice.Membership.Entra. Resolves a caller's full transitive Entra group membership when a token's groups claim overflows, and supplies EntraGraphIdentityDirectory, which admin surfaces use to search and validate Entra user and group ids; both share one app-only Microsoft Graph client, authenticated either through the MSAL confidential-client token cache, with its access token cached and transparently refreshed through a single shared in-flight refresh, or from a supplied token credential with no client secret. Isolates the Microsoft Graph and MSAL dependencies from the core Entra authenticator package.",
